    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## The Creative Director\r\n\r\nThis bot focuses on making information look amazing.\r\n\r\n1. Import your guide from the Backpack and add it to the chat.\r\n\r\n2. Tell the bot who your audience is.\r\n\r\n3. Ask it for ideas to improve its appearance. Try asking: \"How can I make this pop?\" or \"Does my layout look too crowded?\"\r\n\r\n   If you love a color or layout, tell the bot why! You're the artist her.\r\n\r\n4. Consider using the shapes and templates to add ribbon banners, callout boxes, or icons.\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
